id\": \"allow-ls\"'` prints `5` \u2014 two concurrent clients are both served every verdict, so the note describes queueing, not breakage.", "commit_hash": "6847c9b", "worker_status": "complete", "worker_summary": "Wave recovery: work already merged to main (verified via merge-base). Closing row with actual commit hash."}
